DWeb	Decentralized Web
ENS	Ethereum Name Service—a decentralized naming system
IPFS	InterPlanetary File System—a decentralized storage and retrieval protocol
IRC	Internet Relay Chat—a simple, open protocol for real-time messaging
IETF	Internet Engineering Task Force—the standards body for the internet
IRTF	Internet Research Task Force—the research arm of the IETF
RFC	Request for Comments—a formal document from the IETF or IRTF
